meta {
  name: Auth - Login with a two-factor code
  type: http
  seq: 73
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/auth/login
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "{{EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{PASSWORD}}",
    "code": "123456"
  }
}

docs {
  For an account with two-factor authentication (#1256). Without code or recovery_code, the login answers 401 with metadata.two_factor_required = true. Send the code of the authenticator app, or "recovery_code" instead (each recovery code works once). The session and the token start only after both factors. Rate limited with the web login (5 per minute per email and IP).
}
